From b36c1ef8b1045c5d47ca1a8aa87053e6fd689059 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tu-kim <taewoo89.kim@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 13 May 2026 22:42:06 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] testbed: ENV-gated profile module with step-event
 decomposition

Adds packages/opencode/src/profile/profile.ts plus hooks in
session/prompt.ts (turn/query/tool brackets) and session/processor.ts
(start-step / finish-step / text-end). All gated by OPENCODE_PROFILE=1;
no-op otherwise.

llm.duration_s captures pure LLM streaming time using first tool.start
or last text-end of the step. llm.step_duration_s separately captures
the whole AI SDK step bracket. turn.end emits post_overhead_s for the
non-LLM/non-tool slice.
---
